StudentOS database migrations

For an existing pre-Alembic database, mark the initial schema as applied once:

    python -m alembic stamp 25b9c5e2c8ce
    python -m alembic upgrade head

For a new database, apply every migration from the beginning:

    python -m alembic upgrade head

Create future revisions after updating SQLAlchemy models:

    python -m alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe the change"
